Third-party notices

docid.py is an independent implementation. Its behavior follows:
- Bob Jenkins' lookup2 hash (1996), placed in the public domain by its author;
- Google's "gutil" hash library (hash.cc, hash.h, jenkins.cc, jenkins_lookup2.h),
  Copyright Google Inc., distributed in Apache Kudu
  (https://github.com/apache/kudu/tree/master/src/kudu/gutil/hash) under the
  Apache License 2.0, with portions under the 3-clause BSD license as stated in
  Kudu's LICENSE.txt.
Test vectors in test_docid.py come from Mozc (src/base/hash_test.cc,
Copyright Google Inc., BSD 3-Clause License) and from comments in gutil hash.h.
